<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (We offers a comprehensive, end-to-end age and identity verification platform that serves both online and physical channels, providing a 360-degree solution to meet the evolving regulatory landscape across the EU.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
