148 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (In contrast, the IDPoint Pulse is a handheld device that functions similarly but is designed to be mobile, making it perfect for environments like clubs or pop-up shops, where portability is essential. This device offers the same robust verification technology as the Nexus, with the added flexibility of being able to move with staff throughout venues, providing seamless age checks for customer interactions anywhere on-site.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
