152 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Our technology for Nexus and Pulse, is equipped with over 40 security checks to ensure the authenticity of IDs, leveraging features like watermarks, UV marks, holograms, and other national security features. These checks are completed within 800 ms, providing fast, accurate, and secure verification. Currently, we are awaiting a patent for this technology in the EU via EUPTO.  Our product and company is ISO 270001 certified and our scanners CE certified)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [7]
>>
